

To compile 
1. Make sure the idf_component.yml file is present in the /src folder and has the espressif/mdns lib as a dependency
2. Must run Makemenu command to get the ESP managed components (espressif/mdns) downloaded
2. Update the platfom.ini to include the right path on your local folder for "-I D:/Documents/Arduino_GoogleTV_IP_Remote/managed_components/espressif__mdns/include/"
3. 